    "detailed_description": "Play as an existing or fully customisable political figure, and campaign for the European parliamentary elections of 2024 or many other alternative elections! In &quot;<strong>Vox Populi: Europa 2024</strong>&quot;, you and the characters around you must promote your ideas and your popularity throughout the continent to claim victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/4add277d6f0c850dd8c7741ff2180f30.poster.avif?t=1749914247\" width=618 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/4add277d6f0c850dd8c7741ff2180f30.webm?t=1749914247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/4add277d6f0c850dd8c7741ff2180f30.mp4?t=1749914247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose from a host of different scenarios that place the continent in various realistic or fictional situations on different dates. <br></li><li>Recruit your campaign team from a variety of characters, based on their ideologies or traits.<br></li><li>Act directly on European countries or demographic groups to impact their political opinions and voting intentions.<br></li><li>Adapt your strategy to the actions of your opponents and place obstacles in their path.<br></li><li>Push Europe in the direction that suits your ideologies, between Sovereignism, Socialism and Europeanism. Support them, oppose them or combine them.<br></li><li>Face the many unforeseen events that will shake up the continent's political life.<br></li><li>Influence and organise European referendums to change voting rules, the number of member states or laws that directly benefit you.<br></li><li>Collect enough seats in the future European Parliament to ensure your influence on the continent's destiny.<br></li><li>Try to bring the whole continent together, create a single European state or dissolve the Union.<br></li><li>Collect dozens of cards that will help you in the great European debates.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/8c8b19eb7d46e769958a980c3ea9457b.poster.avif?t=1749914247\" width=618 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/8c8b19eb7d46e769958a980c3ea9457b.webm?t=1749914247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/8c8b19eb7d46e769958a980c3ea9457b.mp4?t=1749914247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>This game includes:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>7 different scenarios, past or future, many with randomisation for replayability, adapted to the history and politics of Europe<br></li><li>A detailed, fully customisable character creator<br></li><li>Dozens of pre-existing or randomly generated characters<br></li><li>Dozens of unique ideologies and corpuses<br></li><li>A realistic subdivision of  Europe into countries and demographic categories, each with its own characteristics<br></li><li>Flexible character actions that allow for a wide variety of gameplay<br></li><li>A unique system of triple political path combinations specific to Europe<br></li><li>80 unique events<br></li><li>Dozens of character traits that influence their actions or debates<br></li><li>50 varied cards for dynamic debates between characters<br></li><li>50 possible referendums, fundamentally influencing gameplay or providing various advantages to candidates.<br></li><li>A unique system of parliament and political coalitions based on the ideologies of each candidate<br></li><li>Detailed collections of data and statistics to track the evolution of the electorate and your campaign<br></li><li>And much more to discover!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/0590a1c28d575ce7dab0d6b0e3a4b53a.poster.avif?t=1749914247\" width=618 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/0590a1c28d575ce7dab0d6b0e3a4b53a.webm?t=1749914247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/0590a1c28d575ce7dab0d6b0e3a4b53a.mp4?t=1749914247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Play as an existing or fully customisable political figure, and campaign for the European parliamentary elections of 2024 or many other alternative elections! In &quot;<strong>Vox Populi: Europa 2024</strong>&quot;, you and the characters around you must promote your ideas and your popularity throughout the continent to claim victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/4add277d6f0c850dd8c7741ff2180f30.poster.avif?t=1749914247\" width=618 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/4add277d6f0c850dd8c7741ff2180f30.webm?t=1749914247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/4add277d6f0c850dd8c7741ff2180f30.mp4?t=1749914247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose from a host of different scenarios that place the continent in various realistic or fictional situations on different dates. <br></li><li>Recruit your campaign team from a variety of characters, based on their ideologies or traits.<br></li><li>Act directly on European countries or demographic groups to impact their political opinions and voting intentions.<br></li><li>Adapt your strategy to the actions of your opponents and place obstacles in their path.<br></li><li>Push Europe in the direction that suits your ideologies, between Sovereignism, Socialism and Europeanism. Support them, oppose them or combine them.<br></li><li>Face the many unforeseen events that will shake up the continent's political life.<br></li><li>Influence and organise European referendums to change voting rules, the number of member states or laws that directly benefit you.<br></li><li>Collect enough seats in the future European Parliament to ensure your influence on the continent's destiny.<br></li><li>Try to bring the whole continent together, create a single European state or dissolve the Union.<br></li><li>Collect dozens of cards that will help you in the great European debates.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/8c8b19eb7d46e769958a980c3ea9457b.poster.avif?t=1749914247\" width=618 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/8c8b19eb7d46e769958a980c3ea9457b.webm?t=1749914247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/8c8b19eb7d46e769958a980c3ea9457b.mp4?t=1749914247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>This game includes:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>7 different scenarios, past or future, many with randomisation for replayability, adapted to the history and politics of Europe<br></li><li>A detailed, fully customisable character creator<br></li><li>Dozens of pre-existing or randomly generated characters<br></li><li>Dozens of unique ideologies and corpuses<br></li><li>A realistic subdivision of  Europe into countries and demographic categories, each with its own characteristics<br></li><li>Flexible character actions that allow for a wide variety of gameplay<br></li><li>A unique system of triple political path combinations specific to Europe<br></li><li>80 unique events<br></li><li>Dozens of character traits that influence their actions or debates<br></li><li>50 varied cards for dynamic debates between characters<br></li><li>50 possible referendums, fundamentally influencing gameplay or providing various advantages to candidates.<br></li><li>A unique system of parliament and political coalitions based on the ideologies of each candidate<br></li><li>Detailed collections of data and statistics to track the evolution of the electorate and your campaign<br></li><li>And much more to discover!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/0590a1c28d575ce7dab0d6b0e3a4b53a.poster.avif?t=1749914247\" width=618 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/0590a1c28d575ce7dab0d6b0e3a4b53a.webm?t=1749914247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842880/extras/0590a1c28d575ce7dab0d6b0e3a4b53a.mp4?t=1749914247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
